WEBVTT

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.980
Y..You all...

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:19.980
Tired...

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.190
What's happened to you?!

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.790
They're tired from battling it out
with the Orpheus Order.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.400
They didn't even have time to breathe.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:36.390
I, Ana, think I'm dog tired.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.590
I tell ya...

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:41.220
I don't even wanna see
a puzzle for a while.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:43.980
Me too.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.020
I, Ana, too.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.590
Uh, I'm not that-

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:53.280
Right?!

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.540
I know! That is a proper
high-school student's...

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:59.740
Nay, a proper human's state of being!

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:01.740
It's not too late!

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:02.580
For love!

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.410
For conversation, for sweets!

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.120
For study and sports!

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.910
Let's revel in the spring of our youths!

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:11.910
No more puzzles!

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:13.230
No                                                                                          No Way

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.080
Now, finally, you can
all be normal people!

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:20.640
Honestly, you're making
yourself look pitiful.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.300
To think, these are the
Phi-Brain children...

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.410
Erena, what are you doing here?

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.000
Wait, that uniform...

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:32.890
I...

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.490
have transferred to this school.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:56.970
Lost

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:00.090
Tesaguri de sagashiteta
I've searched, groping

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.010
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
The answer to a future that's been closed off

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.930
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
Is nowhere to be found

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:09.270
Hashiru shoudou, ima kaidoku funou
The impulse to run, it's impossible to decipher now

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.980
Found

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:15.230
Kudaketa hazu no unmei o
A fate that was supposedly smashed

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:19.700
Mijuku na yume no naka de kikoeta kitanda
I've come to hear it within that half-formed dream:

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.530
Saigo made I'll be there for you
Until the end, I'll be there for you

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.620
Tachidomaranai, kono hari dake wa
It won't stop, not this needle

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.960
Boku no asu o kizamu oto o tsukisasu
It will pierce the sound that engraves my tomorrow

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.870
Shinjitsu kara nigetara ima
If I run from the truth, then now...

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.580
Genjitsu ni mo maketara ima
If I lose to reality, then now...

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:34.920
Nani ga nokoru no?
What will remain?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.130
(Nokoru no?)
(Will remain?)

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:39.510
Kazoekirenai kono kizu dake ga
These countless wounds of mine

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.970
Boku no kinou o zanzou to shite kataru
They tell of my yesterday as an afterimage

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.680
Unmei ga hodoketemo ima
Even if fate were unraveled, now...

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.520
Sonzai o kowashitemo ima
Even if my existence were smashed, now...

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.390
Boku no michi o yuku yo
I will travel my path

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.520
It's now or never

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.600
That is what they say

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.690
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:58.360
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.530
That is what they say

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.700
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.200
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.410
That is what they say

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.830
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.040
Puzzle Time Won't Begin!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.510
Erena! Erena! Erena!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.150
Erena! Erena! Erena!

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:22.290
Everyone, students of Root Gakuen,
Erena! Erena! Erena!

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:23.720
nice to meet you-poo!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:25.960
Nice to meet you-poo!

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.540
Aizawa-poo!
Erena! Erena! Erena!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.600
Takeda-poo!
Erena! Erena! Erena!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.620
Thank goodness I was born!
Erena! Erena! Erena!

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.600
POO!
Erena! Erena!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.220
My CD's on sale, so why not buy it, poo?

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.520
We'll buy it, poo!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.510
Pi-po-dee-poo!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.870
Po-po-dee-poo!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.110
How come your ass transferred here?

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.450
That's hardly important, is it?

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.300
More to the point,

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.620
you've had it rough, hadn't you?

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.370
Your fight with the Orpheus
Order or whatever.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.720
Yeah, I guess.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.800
But thanks to that, everyone has started

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.590
to walk the path of normal people.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.280
We've started thinking we'd
like to take a week or so

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.870
to forget puzzles and take things easy.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.230
I like I said, I'm not that-

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.140
Well, what do you say
to a southern island?

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:12.690
Shall I take you? To a southern island?

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:15.040
For the reals?!

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:19.270
If it's to commemorate my transferring,
I don't mind taking you.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:23.030
Yes! That's awesome!

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.700
Incredible!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.940
It's so big!

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.490
Miss Mizutani, Miss Sakanoue,

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.970
please don't go off on your own.

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:01.200
Okay!

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.440
The island's nice, isn't it?

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:04.920
Yes!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:09.380
But was it really all right
to have brought us too?

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.580
I'm not even at the same school.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.710
What are you saying?

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.080
You've both suffered because of
the Orpheus Rings, right?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.080
Huh?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.250
Uh, no, never mind, don't worry about it.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.160
Also, the more friends,
the more fun it is!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.520
Hey, let go of me!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.250
You're blushing!

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.380
Still, Nonoha couldn't make it, huh?

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:38.290
Approx. 12 Hours Earlier
Japan Time: Around 3:00 PM

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.480
I never thought there would be a conflict
with her club tournaments.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.320
Shoot!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.260
Attack!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.820
Three of them, no less.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.370
Well, knowing her, she'll probably
swim her way here.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.800
That southern island...

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:57.080
I will...

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.710
go there!

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:01.830
Just you wait!

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:08.310
Everyone, welcome to the POG's
super-exclusive resort!

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.920
Heh, this is pretty awesome.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:12.980
It's wonderful!

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:13.730
Yes!
It's wonderful!

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:14.690
Yes!
All right, I get first dibs!

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.480
Ah! Wait up, bastard!
All right, I get first dibs!

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:18.510
Move!

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:23.130
I ain't lettin' you be the first one in!

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:24.760
It won't open!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:25.640
What?

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.740
Oh, it's a puzzle.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.120
What'd you say?

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.890
Look, there are plus signs on the doors.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.570
Plus is the opposite of minus.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:34.640
The opposite of "pull."

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.620
Meaning, you have to push!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:41.790
Won't open, will it?

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:48.410
Why would this be a puzzle?

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:51.400
I'll say this up front:

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.890
Puzzles are forbidden
while we're on the island.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:58.540
Sorry, I think I might have misheard you.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:00.640
What did you say?

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.900
I said, puzzles are forbidden.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.410
Huh?!

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:06.410
Hey, that's goin' a little far.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.840
Nonoha asked me:

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:12.140
To make sure you all
don't do any puzzles.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.290
What'd you say? Nonoha?!

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.040
This is a vacation.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.410
Forget about puzzles.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.670
It's so pretty!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.760
There's ocean everywhere you turn!

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.710
This is a solitary island
in a faraway sea.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.290
There's ocean 360 degrees, on all sides.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.990
Just relax and enjoy yourself.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.520
Thank you, Miss Erena!

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.460
Just call me "Erena."

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.270
We're the same age, right?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.780
Okay, Erena!

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:54.620
Whoa, this room is awesome!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.710
What's that?

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.940
The whole room is nothing but puzzles!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:01.620
And they're all pretty good ones!

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.870
This is a POG resort, all right.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.630
It's like being inside a toy chest.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.950
I'm gonna solve 'em all!

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.670
No, I'm gonna solve way more than you!

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:17.330
Puzzles are forbidden! Got it?

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.370
Yes...

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:20.790
Okay, okay, let's go to the beach.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:32.740
Well? This is a celeb getting serious!

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:36.040
Yes, it feels great.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.870
Ana, you're so pretty!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.870
I..It's a bit frustrating though.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.420
Now hurry up!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.850
Get in the ocean!

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.480
Dammit!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:58.120
What're you doin'?!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.520
I'm bored.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.700
Let us do some puzzles!

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:36.970
Yeah, open up that puzzle room!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.580
Fine, then grovel on all fours and beg.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.890
Then I'll think about-

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.390
Please, Mistress Erena!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.670
Do you all have no pride?

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:48.900
Forget it, puzzles are forbidden.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.490
Pizzlu reem, woll upin.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.240
Huh? What?

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.490
His words have become a puzzle!

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.870
Oh, he's switching out the vowels!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.480
Pizzlu reem...

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.450
woll upin!

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.250
Kaito's desires have
crossed the threshold!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.260
Tuka tho kiy!

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.830
Tuka tho kiy!

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:23.490
Tuka tho kiy
Take the key

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:24.210
I told you, puzzles are
forbidden, didn't I?!

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:25.520
Pizzlu reem woll upin!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.460
Feels like youth, huh?
Pizzlu reem woll upin!

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.020
Um, I'm not sure.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.520
Pizzlu, pizzlu, pizzlu!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.030
Enough of this!

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.750
As if I'd ever give it to you!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:45.920
Wench! What about the key?!

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.330
Like I care!

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.460
Wh..What's that?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.000
What?

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.690
"Puzzle"?

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.290
What is that stone?

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.030
A monument or something?

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:03.370
Well, this is a POG island.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:05.470
Could it be a Puzzle of Fools?

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:07.960
Impossible...

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.240
You know this?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:12.370
But why is it here?

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:18.570
What they call the most horrible thing
the POG ever produced...

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.290
It's...

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.940
No more puzzles!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.960
Give me tropical paradise!

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:44.330
H..Hey, you all!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:47.930
So, it's a crazy dangerous puzzle, right?

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.270
Then, we've gotta solve it!

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:52.660
"Puzzle time, let's begin," huh?

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:53.400
Hey, that's-

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.600
I, Ana, will work to solve it too!

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.370
At least listen...

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:01.730
till I'm done talking.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:02.740
I swear!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.830
It's in there.

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:06.480
Ready to go?!

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:07.530
Wait!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.200
I thought this might happen, so...

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.370
There could be some strange bugs here.

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.550
Hey, we're goin'!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.720
Don't fall behind!

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:27.920
This is...

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.080
The path branches off.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.850
So, this is the first puzzle.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.360
Right or left?

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.810
One out of two, huh?

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.230
It's simple, but the level
of difficulty is high!

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.840
But there are no hints or anything.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.610
Can we really solve this?

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.870
Don't worry, Cubik.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:50.460
If it's a puzzle, there's
sure to be a hint.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.110
Somewhere, that is.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:53.620
If it's a puzzle.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.650
Dammit, where's the hint?!

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:58.800
I'm telling you, what's
here isn't a puzzle; it's-

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.230
I knew it!

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:01.630
Looking through this crack here...

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.380
The answer is "Right"!

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.990
RIGHT

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.640
That's my Kaito, all right!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.140
I'll get the next one.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.810
Not a damn chance!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.270
Having a Japanese character
here is just strange!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.140
Jeez!

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.920
Look carefully!

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:23.530
There are no more places to look.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.940
Don't give up, it's gotta be here!

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:27.770
Stick with it, stick with it!

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.140
What this time?

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.830
A..A skull!

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:42.630
So, that's where it was.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.430
Okay, now it's finished!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.540
That puzzle was a lotta work.

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:50.480
Let's go to the next one.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:51.370
Yeah!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.520
Stop!

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:58.910
I've been telling you to
listen to me, haven't I?

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:03.090
Okay, what's in here isn't a puzzle.

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:04.950
What's hidden in here is-

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.150
Antoinette...

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:09.370
You can't fool us like that anymore.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.250
I don't know what Nonoha told you,

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:14.750
but we will solve this puzzle.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.750
Releasing dangerous
puzzles is our mission.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.630
No matter how many people try to stop us.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.760
All right, on to the next puzzle!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:25.510
Yeah!

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:29.310
Okay!

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:30.890
Poifect!
Okay!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.020
Complete!

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:37.910
It's a magic square, huh?

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.300
No mistake about it.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.130
This cell is 11.

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.780
The cells not filled in by dirt or sand

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:48.720
make a 6 x 6 magic square.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:50.270
I get it.

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:52.030
Well, let's hurry and get started.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.040
Both of you, follow my instructions.
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.040
Just do what you want.
Hooray! Hooray!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:01.420
Finished!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.790
Yes!

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.090
Okay, on to the next one.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.170
I'm definitely solving this one.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.170
No way that will happen!

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.330
We should solve it together.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.550
Everyone getting along is the best, huh?

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:18.460
Where did they go, my
brother and the others?

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:19.830
Find them?

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.020
Uh, no.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.400
I didn'tt see them either.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.500
Do you think something happened to them?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.960
If Himekawa's with them,
I don't think we have to worry.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:30.830
Everyone!

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:35.870
In looking for Kaito and the others,
I found something most grave!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:42.880
It looks like the next
one's the last stage.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.710
Wh..What's this?

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.290
For the reals?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.090
Wow!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.580
That's...

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:06.710
This is a puzzle?

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.990
It's Puzzla.

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:11.870
Puzzla?

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.120
Yes.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.240
The heck is that?

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.290
I told you, didn't I?

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:20.040
The most horrible thing
the POG ever produced.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:24.040
Oh, so what was written on the sign
at the entrance was...

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.920
Yes, "Puzzla."

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:29.170
This isn't some puzzle!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.540
You get that now, right?

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:31.960
No.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.790
This is a puzzle too.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:36.910
Are you an idiot?

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.760
I can hear it...

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.020
The puzzle's voice.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:42.940
"Solve me."

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:45.320
That's what it's saying!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:51.000
Whether it's a puzzle
or not, I'm gonna do it!

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.740
I'm the one who'll do it in the end!

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:56.710
Look, how could this be a puzzle!

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:57.990
Jeez!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.620
It don't look like a puzzle at first glance,
but that's a trap!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.000
Great job, Kaito!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.460
I've got it! That!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.280
That shell's gotta be
the puzzle, no doubt!

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:09.080
What?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.330
True enough, those look like numbers.

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.370
All right, I'm doin' it!

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.130
Wait up!
All right, I'm doin' it!

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.080
Scary...

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.700
I thought we were done for.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:49.750
Puzzla's frame is old and will collapse easily,
so be careful, 'kay?

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.870
You shoulda said that!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:55.330
I tried to but you wouldn't listen!

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:58.010
U..U..Uncle!

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.710
What is this?

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:03.850
Beats me.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:05.250
Be careful.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.730
Yes, I know.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.060
Hey, look.

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:10.020
Are those footprints?!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.170
A bit bigger than your
wife's, aren't they?

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:14.670
I'm not so sure.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.460
Wait, come to think of it...

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:17.380
What is it?

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.240
I've heard of this.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:20.820
It must be...

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:22.530
There's something there!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:24.720
It's Puzzla!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:38.580
This is called "Great Monster Puzzla."

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:42.050
It's a sci-fi film the POG made long ago.

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:47.000
They spent a ton of money on the budget,
but it was a major flop.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.310
I bet.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:53.210
Its existence is now the darkest spot
on the POG's history.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:55.530
It is forbidden to even be spoken of.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:56.940
It's that horrible.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:00.460
I never dreamed it was
filmed on this island.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:06.500
Thus, Puzzla sunk into the
darkest of dark depths.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.600
However,

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:12.150
as long as foolish humans
continue to long for puzzles,

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:15.820
a second or even third Puzzla...

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.940
could be born, yes?!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.290
Still, solving a puzzle
that doesn't even exist...

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:31.290
You guys really are
genius-level puzzle fools.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.730
Now you get it, right?

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.880
Trying to have us rest without puzzles

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:36.880
was doomed from the start.

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:40.800
Especially for this super
fool of a puzzle fool.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:41.690
What was that?!

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:43.990
Oops, I spoke the truth.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:45.840
Honestly...

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:50.960
Fine, then starting now, I'll use puzzles
to smack you guys around.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.080
Puzzle drill camp will now begin!

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:58.820
I'll use the puzzles here to put

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.530
you through some special training.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:01.340
How's that?

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.290
Suits me fine!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.520
But first, what about the
key to the puzzle room

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.670
that you threw away?

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:14.500
Well, it's gone, so that's that, huh?

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:15.320
Hey!

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:17.170
Just give up on...

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:35.780
Nonoha?!

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.350
No way!

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:52.300
Nonoha!

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:54.970
Hey...

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.610
Don't tell me...

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.150
Nonoha!

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:05.780
Nonoha...

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.580
There was no boat, so...

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.260
I swam here.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:16.620
There's no "heh" about it.

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:19.040
That's some crazy determination.

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:21.910
It was tough.

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:23.260
That's...

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.090
The key to the puzzle room!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.450
Sorry for the wait, everyone!

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:29.620
Come, let's revel in the
spring of our youths!

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:31.790
Let's get our tropical time started!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:32.410
Nonoha!

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:34.810
Great job!

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:36.170
What?

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:39.960
We found the key!

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:44.190
Let's get our special
puzzle training started!

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:46.790
Nonoha, you hurry up and come too!

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.200
Huh?!

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:51.320
Thank you, Nonoha!

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:52.730
We did it!

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:53.370
Wait, dammit!

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:54.140
I leave this to you!
Wait, dammit!

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:56.030
I leave this to you!
What's the meaning of this?

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.990
What about beach volleyball?

00:21:57.990 --> 00:21:59.220
Splitting watermelons?

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:00.750
Tropical fruit?

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:03.770
You're saying you don't
want to see my sexy bikini?

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:04.820
Seems like fun, Erena.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:08.050
Hey! Hey! What're you doing, Kaito?

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:08.050
Good thing you transferred, huh?

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:10.610
Look, don't try to hide in the water.

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:12.220
I don't especially...

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:13.740
Hey! What about my tropical time?!

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:17.580
Hey, I swam six hours to get here!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:18.730
HEY!

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:24.810
Come on, just give it up, Nonoha.

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:28.070
Women should have good grace.

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:30.060
No way!

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.050
Eiyuukidori
Playing the hero

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:44.940
Itsudatte shinjita muteki no kankaku
A sense of invincibility you always believed in

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.370
Tatakatte iru no wa chikyuu no tame nanka ja nai
You're not fighting for the sake of the world or anything

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.160
Motto maipeesu de
It's for a more leisurely

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:59.230
Sou, motto shoujiki na onegai no tame
Yeah, more straightforward request

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:07.670
Nandotonaku kizutsuitemo tachiagare, hero
Even if you're wounded over and over, rise up, hero

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:13.220
Kitto daijoubu, kimi o mamorunda
It's sure to be all right, I'll protect you

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:17.040
Machigai da to shitemo tomarenai
Even if it's wrong, it can't be stopped

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.650
Seikai ka nante wakaranai
I don't know if it's the right answer

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.660
Donna toki demo original ni
No matter the situation

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:27.400
Step o fumidashiteku
I'll take those first steps, originally

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.770
Dramatic ni, mawaru sekai de
On this spinning world, I'm searching, dramatically

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:34.430
Kiwameita wonder sagashiteru
For wonders that sparkle

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:38.430
Boku, shijou saikou no tabi o tsuzukeyou
Me, I'll keep going on the greatest journey in history

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:42.740
Image shite shiawase na mirai e
To the happy future I imagined

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:46.060
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:51.380
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:52.800
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:56.260
(Mirai e)
(To the future)

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:04.200
Go, go, Naoki, Naoki!

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:06.000
Go, go, Naoki, Naoki!

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.990
At last we've arrived
at that southern island!

00:24:07.990 --> 00:24:10.080
Naoki, there's not a single girl around.

00:24:10.080 --> 00:24:11.670
They've been driven off
by the smell of our sweat.

00:24:11.670 --> 00:24:12.310
Imbecile!

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:14.570
Work is suppoed to make you sweat!

00:24:14.570 --> 00:24:18.020
Okay, let's haul this
portable puzzle shrine to the temple.

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:20.430
That will increase our
puzzle abilities threefold!

00:24:20.080 --> 00:24:26.540
Even Nonoha Wants to Solve Them!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:22.520
Next time, "Even Nonoha
Wants to Solve Them!"

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:23.790
Go, go, Naoki, Naoki!

00:24:23.790 --> 00:24:25.780
Go, go, Naoki, Naoki!
